y eighth page.":"四十頁，橫跨五本筆記本。掌握階段每八頁。","Start":"開始","Results":"結果","Retry":"重試","Title":"標題","How to play":"玩法說明","Paused":"已暫停","Resume":"繼續","Restart round":"重新開始回合","Leave round":"離開回合","Equal neighbours":"平等嘅鄰居","Numbers that match can be connected. Tap the two 4s — equal numbers always pair.":"匹配嘅數字可以連接。㩒一下兩個4 — 等數永遠配對。","Now clear the last pair on your own.":"而家自己清咗最後一對。","Making ten":"做緊十個","Pairs that add to ten also connect. Connect 3 and 7.":"加成十嘅對亦都連接埋一齊。連接3同7。","The two 5s are equal AND sum to ten. Clear them to finish.":"兩個5係等於同埋加埋十。清除佢哋就可以完成。","Down the column":"向下欄","Pairs connect down a clear column too. Connect 2 and 8.":"成對亦都連接落一條透明嘅柱。連接2同8。","Now 1 and 9 down column one.":"而家1同9落第一欄。","Finish the board: 6 and 4 make ten.":"完成板：6同4成十。","Across the fold":"橫跨摺疊","Paths follow reading order and may fold onto the next row: 7 and 3 make ten across the fold.":"路徑遵循閱讀順序，並且可以摺疊到下一行：7同3係摺疊嘅十個。","Now 6 and 4 make ten along the row.":"而家6同4沿住行整十個。","Finish with the two 5s.":"用兩個5完成。","Open lanes":"開放車道","Empty cells never block a path. 4 and 6 connect through the gap... they sit in one row with 1 between them — blocked! Connect 1 and 9 down the open middle instead.":"空嘅細胞永遠唔會阻住一條路。 4同6係透過個隙連接埋一齊 ... 佢哋坐喺一排，佢哋之間有1個 — 阻住咗！將1同9連接落開放式中間。","Now the top row is open: 4 and 6 make ten.":"而家頂排開咗：4同6係十個。","Finish with 3 and 7.":"用3同7完成。","Running low":"跑低咗","When nothing connects, Add Rows rewrites the remaining digits as fresh rows. Clear 2 and 8 first.":"當冇嘢連接嗰陣，加行會將剩低嘅數字重新寫成新行。先清除2同8。","Now clear 7 and 3.":"而家清咗7同3。","Only a lone 5 remains — press Add Rows.":"只剩下一個單一嘅5 — 撳新增行。","The 5s connect down the column. Clear them.":"5 連接落柱。清除佢哋。","First Lines":"第一條線","Equal numbers and small sums.":"等數同小和。","Tens":"十位","Full sum-to-ten range.":"全和到十嘅範圍。","Long Lanes":"長巷","Longer rows, longer paths.":"行長啲，路徑長啲。","Cross Hatching":"交叉排線","Columns matter.":"直行好緊要。","Crowded Page":"擠迫頁面","Denser board.":"更密嘅棋盤。","Thin Margin":"細邊","Fewer equal pairs.":"少啲等對。","Deep Stacks":"深層疊層