giving.":"高大，無情。","Ten-Move Tango":"十招探戈","Clear a small page in at most ten moves.":"最多十步之內清除一個細頁面。","Ninety Seconds":"九十秒","Beat the clock: ninety seconds, one page.":"Beat the clock：九十秒，一頁。","Narrow Lanes":"窄巷","An altered six-column layout changes every path.":"改變咗嘅六列佈局會改變每條路徑。","Unaided":"無人幫助","No hints, no undo. Trust your reading of the page.":"冇提示，冇復原。相信你對呢個頁面嘅閱讀。","Field Notebook":"野外筆記本","Dusk Study":"黃昏研究","Mint Ledger":"薄荷分帳","Slate Archive":"板岩封存檔案","Sugar Draft":"糖稿","First Clear":"首次通關","Clear your first board.":"清空你嘅第一個棋盤。","Lane Reader":"巷讀者","Clear a pair via each path type: row, column, and fold.":"透過每種路徑類型清除一對：行、列同摺疊。","Seven-Page Streak":"七頁連續","Clear boards on seven different days.":"喺七個唔同日子清空棋盤。","Mastery Bound":"精通界限","Complete any Mastery stage in the Journey.":"完成旅程中任何精通關卡。","Long Game":"長局","Clear one thousand pairs in total.":"總共清除一千對。","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"已從你的 StarHermit 雲端存檔還原進度。","Pointer and touch: tap two tokens to connect them; tap empty paper to cancel. Every round action is in the tray.":"指針同觸摸：撳兩個令牌嚟連接佢哋；㩒一下空紙就可以取消。每一輪動作都喺托盤入面。","Sound, graphics, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"聲音、畫面、語言、放大文字、高對比同減少動態效果嘅設定喺 StarHermit 選項入面。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Key bindings":"按鍵設定","Board: {label}. Personal bests are kept on this device and synced with your account.":"棋盤：{label}。個人最佳紀錄會儲喺呢部裝置，並同步到你嘅賬戶。","Save":"儲存"}
